flowchart TD
  A[Push or pull request] --> B[npm ci]
  B --> C[Jest tests]
  C --> D[Production build]
  D --> E[Markdown and repository checks]
  E --> F[Project tree and SVG checks]
  F --> G[CodeQL and secret scan]
  G --> H[Dependency review and audit report]
  H --> I{Required checks pass?}
  I -->|No| J[Fix or investigate]
  I -->|Yes| K[Review and merge]
  K --> L[Tag release when approved]
  L --> M[Build release artifact]
